# API
# Required: development, test or production. Development and test switch the paywall
# off when Stripe is unset; production refuses to start without every provider.
NODE_ENV=development
API_PORT=8787
# Stripe (the subscription paywall). Setup: docs/plans/billing.md. Leave the first three
# empty outside production: every signed-in account is then treated as subscribed. To test
# payments locally, fill them with test-mode values and run:
#   stripe listen --forward-to localhost:8787/api/billing/webhook
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY is a restricted key (rk_...), never the account's full secret key.
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
STRIPE_PRO_PRICE_ID=
# This app's Customer Portal configuration (bpc_...). Required in production; outside it
# the shared account's default configuration is used when empty.
STRIPE_PORTAL_CONFIGURATION_ID=
